@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description

state "Planned\n(stable occurrence ID)" as Planned
state "Admitted\n(.due true for one scan)" as Admitted
state "Missed\n(reason kept in trace)" as Missed

[*] --> Planned
Planned --> Planned : pre-admission provider\ncorrection moves planned time
Planned --> Admitted : all conditions true inside\nPulse crossing / Window /\nRun late-start interval
Planned --> Missed : ConditionsFalseAtPulse\nObservationGap\nLateStartExpired\nCorrectionPastHighWater\nEventWithdrawn
Admitted --> [*] : at most once;\nno rearm, no duplicate
Missed --> [*] : never queued\nor replayed
@enduml
